(Brown Butter Shortbread) Tj T*
(Makes 16 squares) Tj T*
(INGREDIENTS) Tj T*
(1 cup unsalted butter) Tj T*
(1/2 cup powdered sugar) Tj T*
(2 cups all-purpose flour) Tj T*
(1/2 teaspoon salt) Tj T*
(METHOD) Tj T*
(1. Heat the oven to 325F.) Tj T*
(2. Mix the butter, sugar, flour and salt into a dough.) Tj T*
(3. Press into a pan and bake until pale golden, 30 to 35 minutes.) Tj T*
